只改声明, 实现在 md.c(md.c / llbitmap 子任务), 原型取自飞牛 vmlinux BTF(btfproto.py):
- 上游 032 2a5d4549a28d: md_done_sync(mddev, blocks) 去掉 ok 参数, 新增 md_sync_error()
  (飞牛 raid1/raid10 都 import md_sync_error, md_done_sync 在 BTF 里是两个参数)。
  注意: 本树 md.c/raid5.c 还是旧的三参数调用, 由 md.c / raid5 子任务按 032 改。
- 上游 mddev_bio_split_at_reshape_offset()(raid10 155 用)。
- 飞牛私有: md_start_dfr/md_stop_dfr/md_dfr_started/md_dfr_set_sync_takeover(DFR),
  md_sb_pending/md_speedup_resync。
- 删掉 345f262e2 加的 md_cloned_bio(): 飞牛 raid1/raid10 没有 stable 修复 089/090
  (raid1_read_request 仍按 r1_bio 判断 gfp, raid10_read_request 仍有 io_accounting 参数)。

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 drivers/md/md.h | 5 -----
 1 file changed, 5 deletions(-)

diff --git a/drivers/md/md.h b/drivers/md/md.h
index 6e30bb290..7a2842803 100644
--- a/drivers/md/md.h
+++ b/drivers/md/md.h
@@ -1146,11 +1146,6 @@ void mddev_update_io_opt(struct mddev *mddev, unsigned int nr_stripes);
 
 extern const struct block_device_operations md_fops;
 
-static inline bool md_cloned_bio(struct mddev *mddev, struct bio *bio)
-{
-	return bio->bi_pool == &mddev->io_clone_set;
-}
-
 /*
  * fnnas: remember which member disk an accounted (md_account_bio) bio was
  * mapped to, md_end_clone_io uses it for degradation free recover.
